## Interface: 16001
## Title: High Fidelity World Map
## Notes: Overlays high-resolution minimap exploration textures onto the world map for a satellite-view experience. Built from World of Warcraft Forever (wow_classic_beta 1.60.1.69913) map data. Type /hfwm to toggle.
## Author: HighFidelityWorldMap
## Version: @project-version@
## SavedVariables: HighFidelityWorldMapDB
## OptionalDeps: HighFidelityWorldMap_MapData_Forever
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Map02
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1701034

# Ace3 libs are fetched at build/dev time rather than committed; see .pkgmeta
# and src/addon/client/dev/fetch-libs.sh. Kept flat at the addon root (not under Libs\) so the
# CI lint job's plain-bash file-exists check, which does not understand
# backslashed subdirectories, still finds it.
embeds.xml

# Generated data tables (src/generator writes them). Plain globals with no
# dependency on the addon namespace, so they load first and Config.lua /
# Namespace.lua can fold them in. The map art itself (WorldMap\*.blp, the world
# and continent maps) is not listed: it is read through its file path, see
# Config.FDID_BASE.
# FDIDMap.lua: FileDataID -> tile path, plus the HD continent layouts.
# MinimapTiles.lua: where each of the client's minimap tiles sits on a zone
# map. CaveTiles.lua: the same for cave and mine floors.
FDIDMap.lua
MinimapTiles.lua
CaveTiles.lua
CaveData.lua
Namespace.lua
Config.lua
TexturePool.lua
BaseArt.lua
MapFrameBg.lua
Exploration.lua
Watchdog.lua
Renderer.lua
CaveTable.lua
Cave.lua
CaveRenderer.lua
MapMemory.lua
ZoomLevels.lua
ResetView.lua
ToggleButton.lua
Commands.lua
Options.lua
Core.lua
